<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Sing Investments H1 net up 22.2 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Sing Investments H1 net up 22.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    2.98   vs    2.44</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   6.29   vs    5.37</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents) 5.21   vs    4.80</p>
<p>    Operating revenue		  15.56   vs   16.48</p>
<p>    Investment income (loss)	  0.06   vs    0.04</p>
<p>    Other income			  0.13   vs    0.17</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		  8.20   vs    7.99</p>
<p>    Depreciation and amortisation   0.22   vs    0.25</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			4.03   vs    3.46</p>
<p>    Tax				     1.05   vs    1.02</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Sing Investments &amp; Finance Ltd</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
